{{Quote|General, the Republic command&mdash;the entire Hosnian system&mdash;it's all&mdash;gone.|[[Taslin Brance]], to [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]]|<ref name="awakensnovel" />}}
The '''Hosnian system''' was a [[star system]] in the [[Hosnian sector]] of the [[the galaxy]]'s [[Core Worlds|Core]] that contained the [[planet]]s [[Cardota]], [[Courtsilius]], [[Hosnian]], [[Hosnian Prime]], and [[Raysho]].

==History==
===Galactic Civil War===
During the [[Battle of Endor]] an [[Unidentified Imperial armada|Imperial armada]] [[Battle in the Hosnian system|attacked]] the Hosnian System in a surprise attack against the Core Worlds. The [[Fleet|armada]] was met by the [[MC75 Star Cruiser]]s ''[[Temperance]]'' and ''[[Accordance]]''. Although the ''Accordance'' was lost during the battle, the ''Temperance'' took on the survivors and went on to win the battle.<ref name="Temperance Databank" />

A [[Standard month|month]] after the [[Battle of Jakku]], a [[Gender|female]] newscaster from the Hosnian system delivered a news broadcast reporting that an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] surrender was imminent but that the [[New Republic Defense Fleet]] would remain on war footing for the foreseeable future. This signal was intercepted by [[Queluhan Nebula Imperial remnant|Imperial remnant]] forces as far away as the [[Queluhan Nebula]].<ref name="Lost Stars">''[[Lost Stars]]''</ref>

===The New Republic and destruction===
{{Quote|At this very moment, in a system far from here, the New Republic lies to the galaxy while secretly supporting the treachery of the loathsome Resistance.|Armitage Hux to his troops|<ref name="Episode VII" />}}
[[File:DestructionoftheHosniansystem.png|left|thumb|191x191px|The Hosnian system was destroyed by Starkiller Base during the Hosnian Cataclysm starting a war between the First Order and the Resistance.]]
In [[28 ABY]],<ref name="Timeframe">{{Twitter|DelReyStarWars|status/652893780236988420|[[Del Rey]]|quote=So excited to have @claudiagray writing a #StarWars novel with us. SW: New Republic: Bloodline coming 2016. Set 6 years before TFA.|archivefile=File:New Republic Bloodline Twitter Post.jpg}} establishes that the events of [[Bloodline (novel)|''Bloodline'']] take place six [[Standard year|years]] before the events of {{Film|VII}}. ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates the events of ''The Force Awakens'' to [[34 ABY]], so ''Bloodline'' must take place in [[28 ABY]].</ref> the system was home to the [[New Republic]] [[New Republic Senate|Senate]] on Hosnian Prime.<ref name="Bloodline">[[Bloodline (novel)|''Bloodline'']]</ref>

Hosnian Prime and all other planetary objects [[orbit]]ing the system's [[Hosnian's sun|sun]] were [[Hosnian Cataclysm|destroyed]] by a [[phantom energy]] beam<ref name="awakensnovel" /> upon the firing of the [[First Order]]'s [[Starkiller Base]] [[superweapon]] in [[34 ABY]].<ref name="Episode VII" /> Due to the nature of phantom energy, the destruction of the system was visible across the galaxy through a rip in [[sub-hyperspace]].<ref name="awakensnovel" /> It was witnessed by those present in [[Maz Kanata]]'s [[Takodana Castle|castle]] on the planet [[Takodana]],<ref name="Episode VII" /> and those present on [[Vardos]].<ref name="Battlefront II">''[[Star Wars Battlefront II]]''</ref> The beam caused Hosnian Prime's core to ignite in a [[pocket nova]], and temporarily became a binary system.<ref name="awakensnovel" />

